# neegde-tauri — Project Knowledge

## Stack

- **Language**: TypeScript (frontend) + Rust (backend)
- **Frontend**: Vue 3 (Composition API, `<script setup>`), TypeScript, Vite 6
- **Desktop shell**: Tauri 2 — Rust backend in `src-tauri/`
- **Audio**: Web Audio API (equalizer graph), BitTorrent streaming via vozduxan (C++), SoulSeek P2P
- **No router**: hash `#/app-debug` / `#/viz` only for debug/visualizer windows
- **State**: global reactive stores in `src/stores/` + some local composable state

