## Data Directory Layout (`app_paths.rs`)

All paths are centralised in `src-tauri/src/app_paths.rs`. The on-disk layout:

```
{app_data_dir}/
  rutracker/session.json, meta.json, proxy.txt, covers/, webview/
  soulseek/creds.json, covers/
  bt/torrent/, bt/covers/, bt/vozduxan/   (dev builds: dev/bt/…)
  cache_settings.json
  app_debug.json
  general-list.json
  dev/dumps/
```

## Stores (src/stores/)

| Store | Contents |
|-------|----------|
| `entities.ts` | Global registry — `registerEntity` / `registerEntities` for all seen tracks |
| `queue.ts` | `queue[]` + `queuePos`, persisted to localStorage |
| `library.ts` | Likes dict + playlists, persisted |
| `search.ts` | Active search session + last query |
| `auth.ts` | RT login state + SLSK connection state |
| `view.ts` | Current navigation view |

## Track / Album Class Hierarchy

```
Track (src/track/Track.ts)
  ├── RutrackerTrack  — magnet + fileIdx
  └── SoulseekTrack   — slskUsername + slskFilepath

Album (src/album/Album.ts)
  ├── RutrackerAlbum  — torrent + album dir
  └── SoulseekAlbum

track.toJSON() → TrackData (plain object, serialisable)
```

All tracks pass through `registerEntity()` in `entities.ts`, which also calls
`recordGeneralList()` so the debug registry stays in sync.

## Search Architecture

1. **`resolver::resolve_query`** (Rust) — raw query → `{canonical, candidates, intent}`.
   Fast tier: Brave Search (site:genius.com) + Argon2id PoW. Intent: Track / Artist / Album / Lyric / Raw.
2. **`SearchEngine` + providers** (frontend) — canonical string → RuTracker + SoulSeek in parallel,
   streamed rows through normalize / filter / dedup / score pipeline.

## Code Conventions

- **TypeScript strict** — all source files are `.ts` / `.vue` with `<script setup lang="ts">`
- **No try-catch** — never add try/catch blocks; let errors propagate
- **No comments** on obvious code; one short line only when WHY is non-obvious
- **UI strings**: Russian; identifiers: English
- **No state manager library** — stores are hand-rolled reactive modules (no Pinia)
- **Styles**: scoped CSS in components + global `src/style.css`; no separate CSS files

## Player Flow

```
idle → preparing → buffering → ready | error
```

Prefetch: auto-prefetch next track after ~30 s or ~22% duration.
Three token buckets: `current_token`, `prefetch_token`, `warm_prefetch_token`.

## Tauri Invocations

```ts
invoke("command_name", { args })   // all Rust commands
```

Key commands: `torrent_prepare_stream`, `torrent_release_stream`,
`torrent_prefetch_next_track`, `vozduxan_notify_position`,
`general_list_write`, `general_list_path`, `factory_reset`,
`get_nerd_diagnostics`, `get_user_cache_settings`.

## Build

```
cargo tauri dev      # Vite dev server + Tauri watch mode
cargo tauri build    # Release bundle
```

Vite `define` injects `__APP_VERSION__`, `__TELEGRAM_CHANNEL_URL__`, GitHub URLs.
`tauri dev` runs `npm run kill-dev-port && npm run dev` before starting.
